{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_08",
  "title": "Rhodes Island Cafeteria",
  "storyCode": "DT-8",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a4014efa60fcba90a9adc1bdd3e09339245b81c369bc45c65b91076b2ba98471",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's review all the information we have on Rhodes Island so far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "First, both Big Bob and the High Priest thought they could help us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Second, Kay said there's someone called the 'Doctor' who can definitely solve our problem..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And lastly, it seems we're finally getting close to their ship!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I just hope they really <i>do</i> have a way of solving this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey guys, look!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_0_rhodes3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The three head over to the cliff's edge at Chilchuck's cry. It is then they realize why there was a tinge of worry in his voice.\nThey see a giant, colossal ship.\nIt sails across the land, a vessel much larger than any seafaring ship they have seen before.\nA massive construct of steel. A city. A... dungeon.\nThis is it. Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...My word, a ship that sails on land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can we really find a way home there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think we've got another problem to deal with first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How are we going to get on board?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't see any entrances, even from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look! I think there's some people approaching the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like a caravan to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A caravan, huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why don't we go talk to them and see if they can bring us aboard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodeslowerdeck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vanguard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good work out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vanguard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No problem. Oh, right. We just ran into a party of four looking for help. They're dressed real funny, said they know Ceobe, and were hoping Rhodes Island could help them go home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? Go home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vanguard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More or less, from what I understand. Would you mind leading the way for them? I'll go talk with Field Operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios's Party",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you came to us for aid, you must be looking for the Doctor or Amiya, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Err... Kay did mention a 'Doctor,' so they're probably who we're looking for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could you set up a meeting for us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have to check your identities first. If you could just follow me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoa! Really sorry, dropped my things..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Bob's Gourmet Guide'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know Big Bob?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure do. He cooked us the first meal we had here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aye, anyone who can make such a delicious meal out of such hard bugs is admirable in my eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I see. So you're the 'friends' he mentioned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm Mudrock. Big Bob told me about you. At the time, he had just decided to leave the mercenary life behind, but had no idea whether starting a farm would be viable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Farms in the wilderness are often targeted by bandits and looters. He didn't have many business connections, and he wasn't sure if the beer he brewed was any good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the joy on your faces as you ate his cooking gave him confidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never realized he was in such dire straits."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is... Is he alright nowadays?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't know. We haven't met in a long while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All I've heard is that his Originium slug beer factory's doing well and making a profit. Seems he's got it made."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good, good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I also heard that he broke some local laws in the process. Some kind of tax issue. He was sent to jail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Jail? Are you sure he's still alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The most recent news I heard was that he either broke out or made bail. Either way, he's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I guess that's... good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A jailbreak, huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've also heard that he set up a grocery store in Sami. Business is good there, apparently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He... knows how to persevere, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anyway, come with me. We'll head up in the elevator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Elevator'? You mean this iron box? How do you use it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like another magic item to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go on inside. We're heading to the first floor. Wait a moment though, I need to get a—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mudrock",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Where did they go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios's Party",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why's everything all different now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where are we? What just happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This place is looking more and more like a dungeon by the second."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...As I have foreseen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, aren't you the Cyclops from Sami?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A Cyclops?! How do you know—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait. If you're here, that means you saw something, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Indeed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, what did you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "On your road ahead, there will be flames, a great shock... and a fearsome beast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you know where Ceobe or the Doctor are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ceobe has just returned. She should be at the training room now, which is that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for the Doctor... Please forgive me for not being able to tell you anything at the moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So... where should we go first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't think Mudrock will find us any time soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is the training room the lady from earlier told us about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doesn't seem like there's anyone here. There's some great big <i>strange</i> thing over there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you lot doing here with that gormless look on your faces?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Eh? High Priest?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you seen Ceobe, High Priest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She was here a moment ago, but ran off somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You guys looking for her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't just stand there then, get your butts over here and sit in this machine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Uh... Sure, okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "High Priest, did you happen to see some lost visitors? We heard they were spotted around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What? No, I haven't. We're about to run an impact safety test on this new model of Big Ugly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I suggest you stand back a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh... Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, Zumama, everything's ready to go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course I'm sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cockpit-Encased Laios's Party",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was it just me or were there people inside that thing when it got blasted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sure about that? Did you <i>see</i> anyone get blasted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, huh... Guess not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just my imagination, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, go look somewhere else. The ones you're looking for aren't here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think this is what they call an 'abuse of power.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They put me in a stew one time, I blew them up one time. Fair's fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where'd you send them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They wanted to find Ceobe, so I sent them to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That part's no lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The smoke from the explosion clears, and the four find themselves experiencing the oddly-familiar feeling of floating in midair. As they regain their senses, gravity begins to do its work.\nSurprisingly, it is P'o-shan Village rushing up to meet them. Dawn watches them with a peculiar expression on her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios's Party",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "AHHHHHHH!!! HELP US—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The four flail about in the air, to no avail.\nHowever, it does not escape their notice that below them is not solid ground, but a near-infinitely deep well."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead of a cold, hard, and most-likely-fatal landing, they find themselves shooting straight into their hole of hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...A tad crude, but I guess that's how she will send them on their way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "May we meet again someday."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did Kay run into the kitchen again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That she has."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But she's been acting oddly this time around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's been unusually silent since her return."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll go have a chat with her, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you alright? Do you feel unwell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uhh... Dunno know how to describe it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've been feeling weird ever since I got back to the ship..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If that's the case, why don't we go to Medical together and let the doctors have a look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Don't wanna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I dunno why, but I feel like... I should wait here by myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh. Alright then. Go get some rest, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oww... My butt..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're in... a kitchen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sniper Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who are you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get behind me, Amiya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Be careful, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like High Priest sent us somewhere where they're not too friendly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "High Priest? Who are you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It came from the room Kay's resting in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go take a look, quick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They mentioned Kay, we should follow them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What... What in the world?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that you, Kay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1424_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My tummy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is going on here? Is this really the Kay we know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1424_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can tell from her emotions that she's still Kay, the one we all know and love."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's still holding on, but she's about to lose control!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is... Is this really Kay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1424_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Howls)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What a handsome hound! I didn't know you could do this kind of thing, Kay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is this really the time for that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We need to get her to her senses!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guests."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Based on what you just said, I suppose you came out of concern for Kay's condition, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, we came because we wanted to find a way back to our world... but we're still really worried for her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then let's save the questions for later and get her under control together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If we can't, then I'm afraid things will get far, far out of hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Laios?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure. We'll work together, for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
